{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[formal]] [[meal]] served in the middle of the day.
#* {{RQ:Allingham China Governess|chapter=2|passage=Now that she had rested and had fed from the '''luncheon''' tray Mrs. Broome had just removed, she had reverted to her normal gaiety.&nbsp; She looked cool in a grey tailored cotton dress with a terracotta scarf and shoes and her hair a black silk helmet.}}
#* {{quote-av |1=en |year=1996 |author=Writing staff |actor=w:Harry Shearer |role=w:Principal Skinner |episode=w:22 Short Films About Springfield |title=w:The Simpsons |season=7 |number=21 |text=''Superintendent Chalmers:'' Well, Seymour, I made it — despite your directions.<br/>''Principal Skinner:'' Ahhh, Superintendent Chalmers! Welcome! I hope you're prepared for an unforgettable '''luncheon'''.}}
