#: {{syn|en|Belgium|qq1=South Island|devon|fritz|polony|qq4=all Australian}}
#* {{quote-book|en|date=3 June 2014|author=John Pratt|author2=Anna Eriksson|title=Contrasts in Punishment: An Explanation of Anglophone Excess and Nordic Exceptionalism|chapter=Understanding differences in punishment|page=31|publisher={{w|Taylor & Francis}}|isbn=9781136216992|url=https://www.google.co.nz/books/edition/Contrasts_in_Punishment/|passage=Filled Roll (x2) ''1x '''luncheon''', tomato, lettuce, and mayonnaise / 1x cheese and onion''}}
